              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekindi, yaabakoba ati: “Mwegendereze bye muwulira, ekigero ky'ogerera abandi weena ky'oligererwa, ate n'okwongerwa kiryongerwaku;",
          "type": "text",
